# IT Incident Severity Classifier

**PKCERT AI & Software Development Internship – Capstone Project**  
**Author:** Sarim Ahmed  

AI-powered triage tool for IT / SRE teams.  
Paste an incident description and get a predicted severity (**Critical · High · Medium · Low**) with confidence.  
Compare multiple incidents and get a recommended handling order.

---

## Features
- Fine-tuned **DistilBERT** classifier (4 severity classes)
- FastAPI inference service with input validation
- Streamlit UI  
  - Single prediction  
  - Multi-incident comparison (2–10 items) with ranking
- Fully free local stack (no paid APIs required for core inference)

